{
  "$comment": [
    "Every show in one place. On each request these values produce: the",
    "archive section, the sliders with their alt texts, the aria-label per",
    "slider and the TheaterEvent entries in the JSON-LD. A change here takes",
    "effect immediately — there is no build.",
    "",
    "alt: leaving it empty means \"Impro-Szene N – Show vom TT.MM.JJJJ\" as a",
    "stopgap. A real sentence about the image is far better — a screen reader",
    "can do nothing with a running number. `make check` counts how many are",
    "still open. Titles, venues and alt texts are website content and stay",
    "German."
  ],

  "upcoming": null,
  "$comment_upcoming": [
    "Once the next date is fixed, enter it here — then the \"Nächste Show\"",
    "section shows the real show instead of the placeholder, and the JSON-LD",
    "gains another TheaterEvent:",
    "",
    "  \"upcoming\": {",
    "    \"date\": \"2026-09-19\",",
    "    \"title\": \"Sturmfrei im Herbst\",",
    "    \"venue\": \"Kulturschloss Wandsbek\",",
    "    \"time\": \"20:00\",",
    "    \"ticketUrl\": \"https://www.eventbrite.de/e/...\",",
    "    \"note\": \"Einlass ab 19:30\"",
    "  }",
    "",
    "time, ticketUrl and note are optional."
  ],

